{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "043124808ef5da64a809b6b8585ff15f660cb2127bd5df78e82e0aa24ab7262e", "ja": "好きって気持ちは……", "zh": "喜欢的心情是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d6f415688fa52afb689f4a315eeef4e1f4d97bf0ea71798d179b6472f0b841fa", "ja": "レッスンが始まったものの、曲を理解する\nためという大義名分を得た亜利沙はあらゆる\n単語で推しへの愛を語り、奈緒や居合わせた\nのり子、桃子を呆れさせるが、春香に認めら\nれ、ますますテンションを高めていく。", "zh": "虽然课程开始了，亜利沙却以理解歌曲为正当理由，用各种词语诉说对偶像的爱，让奈绪以及恰好在场的\n纪子和桃子都目瞪口呆。不过，她得到了春香的认可，情绪也变得越来越高涨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aab6b44c3a00245dca0b9190816525502c1e0b5e4b7b878048a81894759d4d79", "ja": "（レッスンが始まったわけだが、亜利沙は相変わらず、\n推しスイッチが入ったままで……）", "zh": "（虽然说是开始上课了，但亚利沙还是一如既往地开着推活开关……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b7ace59014ac6ccf06ef63cb2f4d93dab1aefc5d2f17f41aa0b3884312278d78", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。はー、喉乾いたわぁ。", "zh": "辛苦啦～。哈——口渴死我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "4a8c13787c5ff3807b80b9e20680d6af2fc8c7ed516a6f91310c5e8f8a2b8d4c", "ja": "奈緒、水飲む？　あそこにたくさんあるから……。", "zh": "奈绪，要喝水吗？那边有很多……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "e590401a559c2797d07bb2d0f7f34c220cb8b57ecaa5e9d18a3ded65fe55cb2e", "ja": "ハッ！　そのお水！　るるちゃんが3年前の\n9月1日にSNSにした投稿に映りこんでた……！", "zh": "哈！那水！Ruru在3年前的\n9月1日发布在社交平台上的帖子里拍到了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "5d13afd545e3c9a22e95d3652211a9b280665f9ddc639ee45f7701513d82d95c", "ja": "……のり子、サンキュー。", "zh": "……法子，谢啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "6c5a9a1a1092915329877c29c2b40e8c0533ab5baea4bb00285bbb5a2b538282", "ja": "春香さん、このあと時間ある？　宿題でわからない\nところがあるから、見てほしいんだけど……。", "zh": "春香姐，你待会儿有时间吗？有道作业题我不太懂，想请你帮我看看……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "c0ee4bbdcfc359a1497e0a1dc605d054fa2d56d7a5458bfb93fee509e183e4cb", "ja": "もちろんいいよ！　どの教科？", "zh": "当然可以！是什么科目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "12c38fdc545f0250b492e84f3de492793972b27e77e82fbe07199347f32119cf", "ja": "国語なんだけどね。", "zh": "是国语啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "57a9509ec957a2e23fc9afb261d6e3c16b6ce8f2b3c3d4f83ad7808d05786c95", "ja": "国語！　るるちゃんの得意科目ですねっ！？\nるるちゃんは感受性が豊かだから、作文も上手です！", "zh": "国语！是露露擅长的科目对吧！？\n露露的感受力那么丰富，作文也写得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "547a91f247d13015c52e5f4ff16ff4fb1498860bd917fa0476f7f28599af585c", "ja": "……ねえ、亜利沙さん、どうしちゃったの？\nなんか今日は一段とうるさいんだけど。", "zh": "……我说，亚利沙小姐到底怎么了啊？\n感觉今天格外吵闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "270267948ce49cbb3fb8c98c75b3ded8adffd217dd3813f053638dd4c055aa6e", "ja": "あー、あれなぁ。色々深いワケがあって……。\nな？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊～那个啊。其实是有各种隐情的……\n对吧？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d26a51673d1612a1598794f6d9562c9a717cee407b2516f8faf346defd78bbf9", "ja": "今回の公演の曲、情熱的だろ？　曲の理解のために自分\nの情熱を語ろう、なんてことになり、そこから……。", "zh": "这次公演的歌曲很有激情吧？为了理解歌曲，大家提议讲讲自己的热情，然后就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "ce0ce095b5aa443e2d29a7c1891479b01140accaf6f725f149c5983e68c2ca62", "ja": "亜利沙さんにそんなことさせたんだ……。\nなるほどね。", "zh": "居然让亚利沙小姐做那种事啊……\n原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "07203c88c419023050232346eaadd1a45b9aea57425acc3024e6746ba6c0ac4c", "ja": "なるほど！？　るるちゃんもよく『なるほど』って\n言いますよ！　言い方がまた可愛いんですよねぇ……♪", "zh": "原来如此！？小露露也经常说“原来如此”哦！而且她说这句话的方式也特别可爱呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "949b23e81d3f868e7ce719f75a64dd6bb1d71ebc3de5dba3dc58c7fd4640eda8", "ja": "亜利沙ー、ちょっと確認しときたいんやけど。", "zh": "亚利莎——我想确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "f902caf9b1bdc0ba5eb572e84c004af3b1b1e69d3d4f0a05c49a728f84607fbd", "ja": "確認！？　るるちゃんもライブ前はいつも、\n立ち位置を3回確認するんです！　プロの鑑ですよね！", "zh": "确认！？小璃璃在演出前也总是会把站位确认3遍呢！真是专业的典范！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2f25b4cb2a5ee52a552ebe53348b7f78a93f4efc70b678f5cc8e2484769c6cc", "ja": "るるちゃんが好きなんはようわかった。でもな、\nそれホンマにあの曲を理解するためになるん……？", "zh": "我明白你有多喜欢露露了。不过，这真的能帮助你理解那首歌吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "b058ca95836771e4fcdd2f18c52270b731dce2727a88dff7b051acfa3ec502c7", "ja": "うっ！　そ、それはっ……。", "zh": "唔！这、这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "647af2bbb58e5d6101b307958a097d2e3ee6ae8a397e3d8556ab89e71ea2d032", "ja": "曲のことより、るるちゃんに夢中になってへん？", "zh": "比起曲子，你是不是更着迷于琉璃了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "bc2e5cb2037492b1dabe2398e59cfd1ee3ec2b02c7e36668598df76253a7aac3", "ja": "う、ううっ……！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "a7013cf4dab0fae8ec263e0873f8e5480e40a03cbe5b8c4e18b6e59458d84e1d", "ja": "まあまあ奈緒ちゃん。私はいいと思うよ？", "zh": "好啦好啦，奈绪。我觉得挺好的呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc3958fdec1f68a9478cce997dd09bae768734eae928871ce58cbc7d3d60f5c2", "ja": "え、ホンマに？　なんでなん？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？为什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "f732d2e67e71030030ee1ac16e68c0f95b192e67b3aa87d570e4c2db9322a169", "ja": "だって、こんなにたくさん、人のいいところを\n見つけられるなんて、すごいことだと思うんだ♪", "zh": "因为，能发现这么多人的优点，我觉得真的很厉害呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "48b504ffedc91bc3042cdcb1431e2e2d7d25a5c63e40e3652b018ea15d1c6791", "ja": "それだけ、るるちゃんが好きっていう気持ちが\n大きいから、こうなってるんだよね？", "zh": "正因为喜欢露露的心情这么强烈，才会变成这样，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "d169d3db4a464c769a27c78dff15fd211bf20e4208bd5e2872f9fa9ee4afad1e", "ja": "はっ……、春香さんっ……！", "zh": "啊……春香小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "3bedb46571240d45ecb92bc9ecfbe0290b3787d0cc63dc60ce03cc2f0af39b92", "ja": "曲も聴かせてもらったけど、好きって気持ちをたくさ\nん込めなきゃ歌えない曲だと思う。だから……ね？", "zh": "歌也听了，我觉得这是一首必须把满满的喜爱之情都融入其中才能唱好的曲子。所以……你明白吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "5146e0392d8697e97538667d6f1666a6285a0ba46022fd907f99a6b3dd4c1a34", "ja": "んーむ……。", "zh": "嗯——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1028_028ari", "source_sha256": "bcad725c3f4b5111d2390779ffd01cc99969a3a43a9bf64fa08e6b81b07b6aa4", "ja": "そうそうそう！　さすが春香さん！　ありさが\n言いたかったことはまさにそれなんですっ！", "zh": "对对对！不愧是春香前辈！这正是亚利沙想说的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "e472ea7d5f225d7f89fbddb813385e83b331bbaf71650baedb48a5b8a8ff49f4", "ja": "うわ、乗っかってきた。", "zh": "哇，顺水推舟跟上来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "0c15547bc6815c8f625e3ac6e6fcc3be3c36133b814fb00b13e4a3eb498d8803", "ja": "あはは……。でも、だから、亜利沙ちゃんの気持ちの\n作り方は、そんなに間違ってないんじゃないかな？", "zh": "啊哈哈……不过，所以我觉得亚利沙调整情绪的\n方式，应该也没错得那么离谱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "585fc8f828911b8da2e465865424790a7b393a5dcf242879193974ddb5bbcbb4", "ja": "……せやんなぁ。\n春香が言うんやし、そんな気もしてきたわ。", "zh": "……确实是这样呢。\n既然是春香说的，我也开始觉得好像真是那么回事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "52226f95a923f06c2d65583b6168d8bcc74532c6238d718bc50b3eab7efca626", "ja": "もう。いくら春香さんがいったからって。\n奈緒さん、チョロすぎ！", "zh": "真是的。就算是因为春香说了那话……\n奈绪姐也太容易被说服了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "a4eb71ec380bbecf585b4a245fe68cec0e28f46cf77d303254fbbe87c92de720", "ja": "むっ？　失礼な。\nあのな桃子、私は私なりに納得したまでやで？", "zh": "嗯？真失礼。\n我只是以我的方式想通了而已啦，桃子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "7cf5fbf48b2d7de655274e5291f809e445bfc6cd69da1c196ce0410f7fb201d1", "ja": "ふーん。ま、いいけどね。最後に困るのは\nデュオ相手の奈緒さんだし。桃子知ーらない。", "zh": "哼——好吧，随你。最后为难的可是双人搭档奈绪小姐。桃子才不管呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0367_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0367_story_02_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "24cab4cddc0758d2026e448a5b1558574aa789d2846d0aac3c915306c52e5f8d", "ja": "桃子ちゃんセンパイ、ご心配にはおよびません！　\nこのありさ、必ずやあの曲をモノにしてみせます！", "zh": "桃子前辈，不用担心！  \n我亚利纱一定会把那首歌彻底掌握的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
